Package: cinminai-table
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12)
Description: Team Table core for the Cin-MinAI assistant (turn tokens)
 Team Table (github.com/Brickmii/team-table), the coordination table the
 assistant keeps on this computer: every request is a task, with its tree of
 sub-tasks, budgets, a size cap per model, the person's requests first, Stop for
 a whole request, and a record of who asked what and how it ended. This package
 is its database core and operator command (python3 -m team_table.admin); the
 MCP server for outside agents is not included.
